  "body": "There's currently [no reliable way to detect when a MessagePort becomes disentangled](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/13662089/javascript-how-to-know-if-a-connection-with-a-shared-worker-is-still-alive), whether due to purposefully calling .close(), or the tab being unexpectedly killed.\n\nAn onclose event was proposed and discussed [several years ago](https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2013Oct/0018.html), but it looks like the discussion petered out after that.\n\nAny hope of reviving it?\n",
